<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Fixlet>
    <Title>Deploy &quot;Lotus Notes 8.5.2 FP1&quot; msi install</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[This task will download 3 files from the "Lotus Notes 8.5.2 FP1" Software Distribution Package onto selected endpoints <BR><BR><B>Installation Command:</B> msiexec.exe /i "ClientUpdate.msi" /qn<BR><BR><B>Run Command As:</B> System User<BR><BR><B>Download Size:</B> 26,446.8 KB ]]></Description>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system AND (if( name of operating system starts with &quot;Win&quot; ) then platform id of operating system != 3 else true)</Relevance>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[/* Relevance generated from file "ClientUpdate.msi" */ (exists file "msiexec.exe" of system folder) AND (disjunction of (NOT exists keys "{7A48BD87-9F3D-4B6D-B247-7AE5883B530B}" whose ( value "DisplayVersion" of it as string as version >= "1.00.0001" as version AND value "Language" of it as string = "0") of keys "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall" of ( x32 registry; (if exists x64 registry then x64 registry else nothing) )))]]></Relevance>
    <Category>Software Distribution</Category>
    <Source>Lotus Notes 8.5.2 FP1</Source>
    <SourceID>&lt;Unspecified&gt;</SourceID>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2011-01-20</SourceReleaseDate>
